{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 3380,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Context 2: External-Project Tier 0 Accesses Librarian via MCP (Proposed To-Be)\n**Symptom:** External project agents hit delegate contribute-tier blocks, Chat-tab Ask timeouts on MCP writes, conflated Context-1/3 acceptance authority, and Applications logs missing authorship/repeatability provenance.\n**Root cause:** Enforce explicit Context-2 authority boundaries (consult research delegation budget, S1-S6b source access, queue/stage_only intake, no vault acceptance, agent-authored & Core-stored Applications/) and dual project/Librarian notifications.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `librarian-context2-external-project-mcp.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-extgoal",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2440,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**1.** tasks External Tier 0 with building or researching in an external project outside Librarian"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-identifyneed",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**2.** frames external knowledge or parallel-read need; calls Librarian MCP (apply / explore / delegate)"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-mcpenv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**3.** records spec_owner=external_project_caller; enforces helper budget, S1-S6b, queue/stage_only, no vault accept"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dmode",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ external-project MCP mode valid?",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-parallelhelpers",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**4.** Lead sets narrowed helper sub-spec; Clerk/Scribe run DeepInfra delegate/dispatch_plan in budget"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-mcpblocked",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns fast structured PERMISSION_UNANSWERED/tier/scope Ticket instead of blind 150s UI hang"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-reusedapp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "confirms unchanged catalogued Sources & matching Applications/ precedent ($0 new spend)"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-checkcatalog",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 2340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**5.** returns verified catalogue citations, ref: handles, spend & checks unresolved external leads"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-notifyblocked",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "reports exact Context-2 MCP authority/route gap & resume choice to external-project user"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-reuseext",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "reuses verified precedent directly in external project"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dmissing",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 2540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ catalogued Sources satisfy external need?",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-userpause",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2440,
      "y": 4140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "receives paused external notice, Ticket ID, & Librarian Agenda resume link"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-userreuse",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2440,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "receives reused Library precedent & unchanged Application link"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-extapply",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 4940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**6.** applies verified findings in external project & submits authored Application proposal"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-queueasync",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 2740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "enqueues unresolved_sources into .librarian/staging/source without hijacking external build"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-ingestchild",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 2940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "⇉ **librarian-ingestion-tobe**: Lead runs narrowed L2 stage_only intake child (sub_spec_owner=lead_tier1 <= Context 2; no accept)",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-epaused",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 4340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ Librarian MCP grant/gate paused cleanly on Agenda; external user notified\n*outcome: paused*",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-ereused",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ existing Library precedent reused without re-ingestion\n*outcome: reused*",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-recordapp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 5140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**7.** validates citations, stores append-only Applications/ + sidecar & auto-enqueues unresolved_sources"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-applypartial",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 3140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "applies held partial evidence in external project & records unresolved_sources leads + spend"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-reuseingest",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 3140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "reconciles reused source note & links candidate to active apply session"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-queuepause",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 3940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "keeps staged/enriched Source on Librarian Agenda for human/Context-1 acceptance; returns resume ref"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dcrit_ex",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 3340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ critical security/data-loss/boundary breach vs mapped shortfall?",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-userhandover",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2440,
      "y": 5340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**8.** receives ext deliverable + locators, spend, Applications/ link & Agenda queued-lead receipt"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-userpartial",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2440,
      "y": 3340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "receives external deliverable, coverage gaps, spend & queued Library Agenda leads"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-escticket",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 4140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "routes critical escalated Ticket immediately with flags, evidence & Rule-8 compensation"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-doctorex",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 3540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "⇉ **librarian-doctor-tobe**: attempts bounded MCP/intake Ticket repair (GLM-5.3 isolated adapter)",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-e1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 5540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ external task completed with repeatable Applications/ precedent & queued leads\n*outcome: success*",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-epartial",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 3540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ external task completed with partial/async-queued Library leads; user notified\n*outcome: partial*",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-notifyesc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 4340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "alerts external-project user immediately with critical Ticket ID & retained evidence"
    },
    {
